			dependencies: ["7C75640ED457CEA4"]
			description: ["The &6HTS Magnet Works&r, &6Helium Refrigerator&r, &6Nitride Magnet Works&r, &6CVI Furnace&r, &6Spark Plasma Sinterer&r and &6Megabar Press&r each take a row: pancakes, quench training, nitride powder, chain composites and rotors, and strain-wave splines. The older controllers and chain strand from the magnetar. The motor, the arm, the field generator and the trap magnet. Rotors and splines by bus; give back the backing plates of spent parts."]
