			dependencies: ["32FA798856B28769"]
			description: ["The &6Ion Implanter&r, &6MOCVD Reactor&r, &6Zone Refining Tower&r, &6Crystal Growth Furnace&r, &6MBE Reactor&r, &6SiC Device Fab&r and &6Fibre Draw Tower&r each take rows for cryogenic gate stacks, float-zone silicon-28, nine boules, quantum wells, power dies and polycapillaries. The UV and UHV controllers you already own, and the new purities. The silicon-28 wafer, the cryo-CMOS die and the mainframe's inputs. Boules and films by bus; recycle what the tower rejects."]
