			description: ["The &6Antiproton Decelerator&r cools antiprotons from gigaelectronvolts to kiloelectronvolts, first by stochastic cooling and then with electrons, and fills them into traps. An OpV hull, the high power and negative-potential casings and the cryomodule blocks. Trapped antiprotons for the antihydrogen foundry. The traps fill slowly, so run a second decelerator before adding a second target."]
