		{
			dependencies: ["5ACC310114FACE71"]
			description: ["The &6Kugelblitz Forge&r crowds so much light into one point that it collapses into a black hole made of light. It is the largest machine of the age. An OpV hull, field-frozen and annihilation shield casing, and fusion coils, with the gamma optics works and a huge power supply behind it. The kugelblitz core, and the Hawking radiation of the collector. Feed power and gammas by hatch; build the shield first and the coils last."]
