		{
			dependencies: ["7F4169BDA6339C6F"]
			description: ["The &6Magnetic Pair Converter&r turns gammas into electron and positron pairs inside the magnetar field, seeded by a positron plasma from home. Only a field this strong allows it. An OpV hull and the field-frozen casing, with gamma light and a rotating-wall positron plasma. The dense positron cell, which only this machine makes. Seed plasma by hatch; the cells go straight to the antihydrogen foundry."]
